WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.080
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.200
An original idea is not always a good idea!

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.350
In this age of remakes and reboots, originality
can be extremely valuable.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:15.680
However, just because an idea is original
does not mean it is good.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:21.080
Dr. Bright is correct that no one has ever
tried to test cosmetics on SCP-682 before

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.429
but that does not mean that putting lipstick
and mascara on the hard-to-destroy reptile

00:00:25.429 --> 00:00:26.960
is a good plan.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:31.050
All Foundation personnel are now required
to attend a seminar on the difference between

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:36.050
an original idea and a good idea before being
allowed to interact with Dr. Bright.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.450
Don't let him be a bad influence on you!

